oster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/b32bfacdc3edc55b5211da3c7b92a5ad.poster.avif?t=1749767496\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/b32bfacdc3edc55b5211da3c7b92a5ad.webm?t=1749767496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/b32bfacdc3edc55b5211da3c7b92a5ad.mp4?t=1749767496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/be08948a8bdeb521ab2a537565823392.poster.avif?t=1749767496\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/be08948a8bdeb521ab2a537565823392.webm?t=1749767496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/be08948a8bdeb521ab2a537565823392.mp4?t=1749767496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/e8687f59bdc39c2ae78c7887c13031cc.poster.avif?t=1749767496\" width=300 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/e8687f59bdc39c2ae78c7887c13031cc.webm?t=1749767496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/e8687f59bdc39c2ae78c7887c13031cc.mp4?t=1749767496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>DF DOLLHOUSE</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to DF DOLLHOUSE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DF DOLLHOUSE is a new animation-only sex/love simulation. It contains animated sexual content featuring three main characters from Legacy DF. This particular game is meant for sexual release only, as there is no story. Navigate through the menu to explore the many familiar scenes and scenarios, now fully animated!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/b26c66a913a9786a6fb6bc93e5085be4.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/b26c66a913a9786a6fb6bc93e5085be4.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/e550f30352003b986d6de7d666339ca6.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/e550f30352003b986d6de7d666339ca6.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/aca6f401bd5a795cd798bebd6199a007.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/aca6f401bd5a795cd798bebd6199a007.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>L'ESPERIENZA</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to L'ESPERIENZA, also known as THE EXPERIENCE!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L'ESPERIENZA contains two games that are voted for each month: GOLD WOMAN - a desert setting, and COLD WOMAN - a winter setting. They are separate from Legacy DF, however both GOLD WOMAN and COLD WOMAN feature characters resembling the matriarch character from the original game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/51d5075b96742bf3aca08ec8b8034782.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/51d5075b96742bf3aca08ec8b8034782.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two lovers ask for your assistance - it is of utmost importance you share your preference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARIA offers you one of two games to update:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GOLD WOMAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An Egyptian royal demands your attention. Expect warmth, sweaty skin, and a desert wasteland.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/703e305b0b449a64f108cf55bc732c11.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/703e305b0b449a64f108cf55bc732c11.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLD WOMAN</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under blue moonlight, a ghost appears. Expect the unexpected and death's softness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/061944b94f4f94aa43f8975fe5d5856e.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/061944b94f4f94aa43f8975fe5d5856e.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>PART II</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A new world is created when one man crosses the line. Part II branches far from its roots, with familiar characters exploring a brand new story: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two paint together in paradise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supper brings an intense inquiry of nightly whereabouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your favorite bench is taken by a thin man on Cobbs Hill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A note is offered to a skeleton in a wicked hallway encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Married in death, two are brought to life again with their promise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Sneaking out at night leads to a deep dive underwater. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >            </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/5ac45f4271711c1fc9049309ef7e8e6b.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/5ac45f4271711c1fc9049309ef7e8e6b.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/4dccfc6f07953a6c7273515bce85a8a0.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/4dccfc6f07953a6c7273515bce85a8a0.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/66745baf028b472e335b59e2625a0f49.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/66745baf028b472e335b59e2625a0f49.avif?t=1749767496 width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras/03294f47e7dcfb5423b20b57533a5b4b.avif?t=1749767496\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3734430/extras_big/03294f47e7dcfb5423b20b57533a5b4b.